   "position": 1,
   "title": "Worth the wait time?",
   "snippet": "Was the 1 & 1/2 hour wait worth it? First, we stood in line for about 45 min. outside. Luckily, it wasn't too hot. They do have some chairs that you can use. Once they opened (at 11am), the line started moving, SLOWLY. We waited another 45 min or so just to order. Be aware that there's not much seating inside. Luckily, we got seating fairly quickly. We had the brisket and ribs. Tender and good flavor! There are condiments, teas, beer, and other beverages. But was it worth the wait? We decided that we would not do it again. But it was worth going once.",
   "rating": 3,
