   "title": "Absolutely exceptional\u2014easy, seamless, and downright delicious!",
   "snippet": "Ordering online and picking up from the trailer out back couldn\u2019t have been more convenient. My order was ready right on time, and the team was outstanding\u2014kind, welcoming, and highly professional. I truly have nothing but praise.\n\nI stocked up for the journey back to Virginia and can\u2019t wait to dig into my stash\u2014brisket\u2026 more brisket\u2026 ribs\u2026 and that tender, shredded pork.\n\nVery respectfully,\nDr. Ken King",
