  {
   "position": 9,
   "title": "The wait is worth it and BRISKET is the BEST EVER!!",
   "snippet": "Definitely the best brisket we have ever had. It doesn't just pull apart, it actually breaks apart when you pick it up, SO tender and juicy. And the servers even took us on a tour of the smoker room which was great! We wanted to see KGs BBQ but he wouldn't let us take a photo with him, so it was so refreshing how wonderful the workers were at Franklins - very welcoming. Definitely the better choice!\nALSO, we arrived early and there was a line of course BUT Franklin's was so great to provide picnic tables and folding chairs for everyone in line. They also had water for all of us and came out to speak with us. The line was on the shady side of the restaurant so waiting really wasn't a big deal.",
